{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04730","headline":"舞马千秋万岁乐府词三首 三 · 张说","name":"舞马千秋万岁乐府词三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远听明君爱逸才，玉鞭金翅引龙媒。\n不因兹白人间有，定是飞黄天上来。\n影弄日华相照耀，喷含云色且裴徊。\n莫言阙下桃花舞，别有河中兰叶开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}